msgid ""
"Beauty Shop is a fast, clean, gutenberg block support and modern looking "
"responsive WooCommerce enabled RTL ready theme built for ECommerce stores, "
"online businesses, accessories, clothing, Dokan, fashion, interior, "
"marketplace, minimal, modern, multi-purpose, responsive, shoes, vendor, "
"beauty shops and stores. Using Beauty shop theme you can use popular page "
"builders like Thrive Architect, Divi, Brizy, Visual Composer,Elementor, "
"KingComposer, Beaver Builder etc. to build your online presence. Beauty Shop "
"is compatible with YITH product compare, product wishlist, WooCommerce "
"Variation Swatches and other popular plugins."
